{
    "title": "Little Panda's Cake Shop",
    "description": "This is a cake cooking game that all kids love. Its 3D graphics and simple operation make you feel like you're baking real cakes! Come and run your own cake shop! Become a cake maker and bake sweet cakes! Create interesting stories at the cake shop and build your own bakery empire! \r\n\r\nCAKE BAKING\r\nAt the cake shop, you can find all kinds of cake baking tools, ingredients and cake recipes, including baking pans, mixers, milk, chocolate sauce and more! You can make holiday cakes, strawberry cakes, cream cakes, doughnuts and any cake you like here! \r\n\r\nCREATIVE DECORATION\r\nYou can use colorful tablecloths, chairs, cups, teapots and other items to decorate your cake shop into more than 20 styles, which will add more fun and surprises to your cake shop story! Come and have a try! How would you decorate the cake tasting area?\r\n\r\nCAKE SHARING\r\nAfter making a cake, you can invite your friends over and share the freshly baked cake or other dessert with them. The happy times you spend with your friends will become your unforgettable memories!\r\n\r\nCome to Little Panda's Cake Shop! Bake cakes, doughnuts and other desserts! Let's create a big bakery empire!\r\n\r\nFEATURES:\r\n- 7 types of desserts: pudding, strawberry cake, cream cake,doughnut and more;\r\n- 20+ kinds of ingredients: egg, flour, butter, cheese and more;\r\n- A variety of cake baking tools: shaped baking pans, oven, beaters, and more;\r\n- A fun cake baking game;\r\n- Build your own bakery empire!\r\n\r\nAbout BabyBus\r\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\r\nAt BabyBus, we dedicate ourselves to sparking kids' creativity, imagination and curiosity,and designing our products through the kids' perspective to help them explore the world on their own.\r\n\r\nNow BabyBus offers a wide variety of products, videos and other educational content for over 400 million fans from ages 0-8 around the world! We have released over 200 children's educational apps, over 2500 episodes of nursery rhymes and animations of various themes spanning the Health, Language, Society, Science, Art and other fields.\r\n\r\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\r\nContact us: ser@babybus.com\r\nVisit us: http://www.babybus.com",
    "descriptionHTML": "This is a cake cooking game that all kids love. Its 3D graphics and simple operation make you feel like you&#39;re baking real cakes! Come and run your own cake shop! Become a cake maker and bake sweet cakes! Create interesting stories at the cake shop and build your own bakery empire! <br><br>CAKE BAKING<br>At the cake shop, you can find all kinds of cake baking tools, ingredients and cake recipes, including baking pans, mixers, milk, chocolate sauce and more! You can make holiday cakes, strawberry cakes, cream cakes, doughnuts and any cake you like here! <br><br>CREATIVE DECORATION<br>You can use colorful tablecloths, chairs, cups, teapots and other items to decorate your cake shop into more than 20 styles, which will add more fun and surprises to your cake shop story! Come and have a try! How would you decorate the cake tasting area?<br><br>CAKE SHARING<br>After making a cake, you can invite your friends over and share the freshly baked cake or other dessert with them. The happy times you spend with your friends will become your unforgettable memories!<br><br>Come to Little Panda&#39;s Cake Shop! Bake cakes, doughnuts and other desserts! Let&#39;s create a big bakery empire!<br><br>FEATURES:<br>- 7 types of desserts: pudding, strawberry cake, cream cake,doughnut and more;<br>- 20+ kinds of ingredients: egg, flour, butter, cheese and more;<br>- A variety of cake baking tools: shaped baking pans, oven, beaters, and more;<br>- A fun cake baking game;<br>- Build your own bakery empire!<br><br>About BabyBus<br>\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014<br>At BabyBus, we dedicate ourselves to sparking kids&#39; creativity, imagination and curiosity,and designing our products through the kids&#39; perspective to help them explore the world on their own.<br><br>Now BabyBus offers a wide variety of products, videos and other educational content for over 400 million fans from ages 0-8 around the world! We have released over 200 children&#39;s educational apps, 